<headline>Farah Inc Q2 shr profit $0.31 vs loss $0.02.</headline>
<dateline>EL PASO, Texas 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr    profit   $0.31	  loss    $0.02</p>
